<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Sonic Shout</ansi> mutation

Your vocal cords have mutated into something inhuman — a resonating
chamber that can unleash devastating shockwaves of sound. The power
comes at a cost; your voice is permanently harsh and grating.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Mouth (vocal apparatus)
<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Active Ability
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Active ability: unleash a deafening sonic shockwave that stuns
  nearby enemies

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced charisma — your grating, inhuman voice puts
  people on edge

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
